      "updated": 1765335528718,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- View List of Problems based on difficulty, Topic, Company Tag\n- View a Specific Problem & code solution for it \n- Make a submission & get feedback \n- Supports contest & corresponding Live leaderboard \n\n----- Out of Scope ---------\n- User authentication \n- user profile \n- Payment Processing \n- Social features like - discussion, solution posting, comments\n- user analytics",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- View List of Problems based on difficulty, Topic, Company Tag\n- View a Specific Problem & code solution for it \n- Make a submission & get feedback \n- Supports contest & corresponding Live leaderboard \n\n----- Out of Scope ---------\n- User authentication \n- user profile \n- Payment Processing \n- Social features like - discussion, solution posting, comments\n- user analytics",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b3QeLqnLHsxkexeN17H12",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1534.6118253264783,
      "y": 31.35333855103812,
      "width": 336.19598388671875,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
