      "updated": 1765342887182,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: System should be scalable to handle peak submission traffic\nduring contests. \n- Low Latency: System should render list of problems & leaderboard near\nrealtime. (<500ms)\n- Availability: The system should be highly available\n- Consistency: It should be reliable and consistent in terms of the\nsubmission. \n- Security: The system should support isolation and security when\nrunning user code.\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Problem \n- Submission ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements (SPARCS):  \n- Scalability: System should be scalable to handle peak submission traffic during contests. \n- Low Latency: System should render list of problems & leaderboard near realtime. (<500ms)\n- Availability: The system should be highly available\n- Consistency: It should be reliable and consistent in terms of the submission. \n- Security: The system should support isolation and security when running user code.\n\n3) Core Entities \n- User\n- Problem \n- Submission ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "A2P4AILlBEj0BXizHjARR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 730.7605346912519,
      "y": 860.986818925092,
      "width": 715.3343118260382,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
