      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "                Defining A Contest\n\n- 90 minutes long\n- 10 problems\n- Up to 100k users\n- Scoring is the number of problems\nsolved in the 90 minutes. In case of tie,\nwe'll rank by the time it took to complete\nall 10 problems (starting from\ncompetition start time).\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "                Defining A Contest\n\n- 90 minutes long\n- 10 problems\n- Up to 100k users\n- Scoring is the number of problems solved in the 90 minutes. In case of tie, we'll rank by the time it took to complete all 10 problems (starting from competition start time).\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
